# NOTE: backend/models/, backend/data/, backend/weather_ml_models/, and
# backend/weather_ml_data/ are intentionally NOT ignored -- both ML
# layers ship pre-trained artifacts + datasets so the app runs
# out-of-the-box without a separate training step.
